From 9ff2aa661e26af43f3e884c7ceba272b9524c8d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stas Darevskiy <stas@stas.gg>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:50:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] rtc-sctp: RACK-TLP loss detection (RFC 8985) behind
 TransportConfig::with_rack

- time-based loss marking on SACK + RACK reordering-window timer
- tail loss probe (PTO = 2*SRTT, +200 ms when one chunk in flight, never past T3)
- one cwnd reduction per recovery episode on RACK loss
- last_sent per chunk so lost retransmissions are detected
- configurable RTO min (with_rto_min)
- SettingEngine: with_sctp_rack, with_sctp_rto_min
- tests: tail loss, early loss w/o 3 dup SACKs, lost retransmission
